  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Training Program for A-HELP Women Workers” is implemented by the Uttarakhand Livestock Development Board (ULDB) under the Department of Animal Husbandry, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to provide community-service-based skill development and employment opportunities for women in the field of animal husbandry.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a woman member of a self-help group formed under the Uttarakhand State Rural Livelihood Mission.\n   1. The applicant must have a minimum educational qualification of eighth pass.\n   1. The applicant must have completed 7 days of Pashu Sakhi training.\n\n<br>\n\n",
